1
00:00:00,674 --> 00:00:03,012
As Uke comes round to grab both shoulders

2
00:00:03,013 --> 00:00:04,212
lead him towards you

3
00:00:04,213 --> 00:00:09,866
as he comes round for the opposite shoulder
take a big step forward
bringing his body completely around you,

4
00:00:10,267 --> 00:00:11,800
turn and cut down,

5
00:00:12,001 --> 00:00:14,247
controlling his wrist as you turn the body,

6
00:00:14,748 --> 00:00:16,882
as Uke passes in front of you

7
00:00:16,883 --> 00:00:17,679
cut down,

8
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,790
step forward and control his elbow

9
00:00:20,591 --> 00:00:24,340
turn completely around the front towards his head
until Uke comes down

10
00:00:24,841 --> 00:00:29,012
Controlling his arm sit down
place his shoulder in between your knees

11
00:00:29,013 --> 00:00:33,007
switch the grip placing the wrist against your body

12
00:00:33,008 --> 00:00:35,962
turn your body towards his head for the pin.

